In article <TIR.90May10190711@tko-sony-12.hut.fi> tir@niksula.hut.fi (Timo Riikonen) writes:
>I have level 22 Heroene valkyria.
>She has probably all other resistances except lightning,
>DIS-INTEGRATION and MAGIC.
>
>Now my trouble is how am I going to get either dis-integration or
>magic-resistance?

I'm surprised you didn't notice this before on the net--it's been a
topic of some controversy.

To get magic resistance, get ahold of a wish (you'll get one, sooner
or later) and wish for (note spelling)

>>> gray dragon scale mail <<<

That's 'gray', not 'grey'.  Also, that's 'mail', not 'armor' (and not
'male').

Makes great armor, besides conferring magic resistance.  Rust-proof,
too.  What the hell, since you're wishing, you might as well wish for
"blessed +3 gray dragon scale mail".  You'll most likely get blessed
armor, though it probably won't be enchanted.

I think for disintegration protection, you have to eat a black dragon
corpse.  Risky technique:  Try wearing a ring of conflict, and summon
a passle of the beasts with a cursed scroll of genocide (which
*summons* the monster you specify).  Just stand away from the blasts.
When they're all dead, tin 'em and eat 'em at your leisure.  (Be
warned:  I've never tried this, and I don't intend to.)
